      "Two “where”",
      "",
      "Little Le's friend got married.",
      "Little Le and her foreign boyfriend Paul went to participate in their wedding ceremony.",
      "This was the first time for Paul to participate in a Chinese wedding ceremony, and he was a bit nervous.",
      "",
      "Paul noticed that the bride was very beautiful and said to the groom: “Your bride is really beautiful!”",
      "",
      "The groom was very happy, but still said modestly: “Not at all”",
      "",
      "Paul thought the groom was asking him “what part of the bride is beautiful”, and promptly said:",
      "“Her hair, eyes, nose and mouth are all beautiful!”"
